---
/* The national wealth gradient, in the reading column. The cards themselves are
 * built by scripts/gradient.ts from the same regions.json the page ships; only
 * the framing prose is here. */
---

<section class="gradient-sect">
  <h2>What remote enrollment depends on</h2>
  <!-- Intro and cards are both rendered by scripts/gradient.ts: the intro quotes
       figures from the first card and makes a claim about all of them, so it has
       to be built from the same list that decides which cards exist. Two copies
       of that list is how the prose starts describing a set of cards the page no
       longer shows. -->
  <p data-bind="grad-intro"></p>
  <div data-bind="grad"></div>
</section>
